-- AC datas : OLD Description : "Pendant que vous m’aidiez, on m’a donné cette rune pour vous, $n. Prenez le temps de la lire. Je pense qu’elle provient du maître des guerriers, Thran. Jetez-y un coup d’œil et allez le retrouver à l’intérieur de Courbenclume.", Description AC enUS : "While you were helping me out, this rune was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the warrior trainer Thran. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance." ; Wowhead enUS : "Read the Simple Rune and speak to Thran Khorman in Coldridge Valley."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = 'Lire la Rune simple, et parler à Thran Khorman, dans la Vallée des Frigères.', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'frFR' AND `ID` = 3106;
